### **Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)**

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Scene1 a ex:AutonomousDrivingScene ;
    ex:hasWeatherCondition ex:FoggyWeather, ex:RainyWeather ;
    ex:hasRoadCondition ex:WetRoadSurface ;
    ex:hasVehicle ex:EgoVehicle, ex:YellowCar, ex:BlackSUV, ex:BlueBus .

ex:EgoVehicle a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isDrivingIn ex:LeftLane ;
    ex:hasReducedVisibility ex:High .

ex:YellowCar a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isDrivingIn ex:CenterLane ;
    ex:isApproaching ex:EgoVehicle .

ex:BlackSUV a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isDrivingIn ex:RightLane ;
    ex:isFollowing ex:YellowCar .

ex:BlueBus a ex:Vehicle ;
    ex:isStationaryOn ex:RightSide .

ex:FoggyWeather a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:reducesVisibility ex:High ;
    ex:occludes ex:TrafficSignal, ex:Pedestrian .

ex:RainyWeather a ex:WeatherCondition ;
    ex:causes ex:WetRoadSurface .

ex:WetRoadSurface a ex:RoadCondition ;
    ex:increasesRisk ex:HydroplaningRisk, ex:ReducedTractionRisk .

ex:LeftLane a ex:Lane ;
    ex:hasVehicle ex:EgoVehicle .

ex:CenterLane a ex:Lane ;
    ex:hasVehicle ex:YellowCar .

ex:RightLane a ex:Lane ;
    ex:hasVehicle ex:BlackSUV .

ex:TrafficSignal a ex:RoadInfrastructure ;
    ex:isOccludedBy ex:FoggyWeather .
```

